resize 540 380
settle 8
key escape
wait-status 600 Retained history: 1 shared nodes, 2 messages
wait-status 60 no local sync lanes opened
record-place 08_joiner_cold_retained
act Place status
settle 3
capture 08_joiner_cold_retained
key escape
act Reconnect place
wait-status 1200 Local rendezvous
wait-status 1200 Retained history: 1 shared nodes, 3 messages
act Send place message
settle 3
type back again
key enter
wait-status 1200 Retained history: 1 shared nodes, 4 messages
record-place 09_joiner_caught_up
touch ${CONTROL}/joiner.returned
wait-status 2400 Retained history: 1 shared nodes, 5 messages
act Save session
settle 8
act Place status
settle 5
record-place 10_joiner_final
capture 10_joiner_final
